  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS Haiti 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNOPS Haiti 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project 1. UNOPS provides temporary housing, as well as income 
creating infrastructure work (Cash for Work). 
Project 2.UNOPS combats cholera spread among 300,000 people, including 80,000 children and 100,000 women, as well as mitigation work focused on the spread of cholera. The efforts include monitoring and emptying latrines so they are not inundated, and an information campaign.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Project 1. UNOPS tillhandah&#xe5;ller tillf&#xe4;lliga bost&#xe4;der, samt inkomst skapande infrastruktur arbete (Cash for Work)  Project 2.UNOPS bek&#xe4;mpar koleraspridning bland 300,000 m&#xe4;nniskor, varav 80,000 barn och 100,000 kvinnor, samt riskreducerande arbete fokuserat p&#xe5; spridning av kolera. Insatserna inkluderar &#xf6;vervaka och t&#xf6;mma latriner s&#xe5; de inte &#xf6;versv&#xe4;mmas samt en informationskampanj.</narrative>
  </description>
